ic trigger.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u53.30093"},{"reason":"Question numbering.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u58.30734"},{"reason":"Frames the multi-family-office question.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u60.30782"},{"reason":"Answer marker.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u63.30942"},{"reason":"Provides the Circular's multi-family-office description.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u64.30958"},{"reason":"Extends the relevance of Q3 factors with the qualifications 'typically' and 'primarily'.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u65.31118"},{"reason":"Records an update date, not a licensing commencement date or deadline.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u80.31413"}],"dimensions":[{"dimension":"scope","explanation":"Q3 addresses a single family office and links regulated services, the business providing those services, and that business's Hong Kong location. Q4 applies the factors equally to cooperating offices; Q5 says they primarily determine multi-family-office licensing.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u34.27560","daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u51.29888","daa1876316641.u53.30093","daa1876316641.u65.31118"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"definitions","explanation":"Family labels and family membership are not licensing criteria. Single-family arrangements are described typically; related entities receive an exact ownership description. Business classification requires judgment, with unresolved wording concerning profit objectives.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u18.26414","daa1876316641.u28.26995","daa1876316641.u39.28171","daa1876316641.u40.28601","daa1876316641.u64.30958"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"The intra-group carve-out qualifies the Type 9 regulated-activity definition, rather than independently defeating every licensing trigger. The genuine-single-family-office passage informs business classification and retains its ordinary-course qualification.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u39.28171","daa1876316641.u40.28601"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"All three factors must be present. 'Should not in the ordinary course', 'may', 'likelihood', 'typically', and 'primarily' do not establish categorical exemptions or automatic triggers. The formalization tests the stated conjunction, not overall legal obligation or licence possession.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601","daa1876316641.u53.30093","daa1876316641.u65.31118"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"The Circular is dated 2020-01-07 and the page update is 2020-09-08. Neither supplies an effective date, assessment period, or deadline for the selected trigger.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u1.25828","daa1876316641.u80.31413"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"The Ordinance and Circular are referenced but not supplied in full. Dependency missing.b8f9c69dd226e4db3f4557d7 has no supplied content or identified mapping. Regulated-activity and business judgments cannot be completed from this packet alone.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u1.25828","daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u39.28171","daa1876316641.u40.28601"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["Does 'or have the pursuit of profit as its business objective' mean absence of a profit objective as an additional condition, or a separate alternative? The wording does not securely resolve its negation or attachment.","What does dependency missing.b8f9c69dd226e4db3f4557d7 contain, and which referenced provisions does it supply?","For the assessed office and services, what evidence establishes regulated-activity status after applicable carve-outs, carrying on a business, and the location of that same business?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The named selected control is Q3's three-factor licensing-trigger test, after regulated-activity carve-outs have been resolved.","The required Boolean label uses 'COMPLIANT' solely to mean that this selected trigger test is satisfied; true does not mean the office holds a licence or complies with licensing law.","All facts concern the same assessed office, services and business in the same assessment context.","Professional assessments retain all source qualifications; unavailable or unresolved facts remain unknown."],"citations":[{"quote":"all of which must be present in order to give rise to a licensing obligation","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u38.27681"},{"quote":"firstly, the services provided by the family office constitute one or more regulated activity as defined under the Ordinance; secondly, the family office is carrying on a business in the provision of such services; and thirdly, the business is carried on in Hong Kong.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u38.27681"},{"quote":"the licensing regime does not hinge on whether an entity is called a family office or whether its clients are families.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u18.26414"},{"quote":"the definition of Type 9 regulated activity contains an intra-group carve-out","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u39.28171"},{"quote":"will need to be determined by reference to the facts of each case","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u40.28601"},{"quote":"not receiving any income, other than reimbursement of operating expenses from the family","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u40.28601"},{"quote":"or have the pursuit of profit as its business objective","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u40.28601"},{"quote":"should not in the ordinary course be considered as carrying on a business from a licensing perspective.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u40.28601"},{"quote":"would not of itself automatically trigger a licensing obligation","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u53.30093"},{"quote":"will be primarily determined by the three key factors set out in the response to Q3.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u65.31118"}],"distinction":"The selected trigger is a conjunction of linked conditions, not a family-status test, an income-only test, or a licence-possession test. The strongest uncertainty concerns supplying the business judgment: Q3 gives non-exhaustive considerations and qualified guidance with an unclear profit-objective clause. That uncertainty supports unresolved factual classification, not an invented competing Boolean connective for the three expressly cumulative factors.","family":"dependencies","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed services of the assessed office constitute at least one regulated activity under the referenced Ordinance after applicable regulated-activity carve-outs have been resolved. The Type 9 intra-group carve-out does not automatically resolve other activity types.","name":"services_are_regulated","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u39.28171"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The assessed office is carrying on a business in providing those same services. Supply through case-specific judgment considering occupation or duty requiring attention, continuity, capacity for profit and profit purpose, without treating the list as an exhaustive conjunction. Retain the genuine single-family arrangement, reimbursement, profit-objective and ordinary-course qualifications; unresolved wording or evidence leaves this fact unknown.","name":"services_provided_as_business","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The same business providing the assessed services is carried on in Hong Kong, as determined from the circumstances. This is not merely the location of clients, shared premises or an unrelated business.","name":"business_carried_on_in_hong_kong","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601","daa1876316641.u53.30093"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"}],"result":"(and services_are_regulated se