ontinuity, capacity for profit and profit purpose, without treating the list as an exhaustive conjunction. Retain the genuine single-family arrangement, reimbursement, profit-objective and ordinary-course qualifications; unresolved wording or evidence leaves this fact unknown.","name":"services_provided_as_business","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The same business providing the assessed services is carried on in Hong Kong, as determined from the circumstances. This is not merely the location of clients, shared premises or an unrelated business.","name":"business_carried_on_in_hong_kong","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601","daa1876316641.u53.30093"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"}],"result":"(and services_are_regulated services_provided_as_business business_carried_on_in_hong_kong)","result_type":"bool","scope":"true"},"local_id":"q3_cumulative_trigger","questions":["How should the profit-objective clause be read when supplying services_provided_as_business?","Do the unavailable statutory provisions impose further qualifications beyond this selected three-factor test?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For the selected Q3 licensing-trigger test, true means all three stated conditions are satisfied: the assessed services constitute at least one regulated activity after applicable carve-outs; the office carries on a business providing those services; and that same business is carried on in Hong Kong. False means this conjunction is not satisfied. Neither outcome determines licence possession or whole-entity compliance. Business classification remains case-specific and preserves the qualified ordinary-course guidance.","subject":"Q3 three-factor licensing trigger for the assessed family office"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.03ac38aa116dcedc3a9c1ae4","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"773eda47be7f7e6881f9a66c1c5018e397af06d47b97a2ec6602f9f8384969f8","candidate_id":"candidate.26acc7764c08420f814c18af071601ed","commitment":"bc087f5d9fbd715608217546f14e0f2525b35954ca451e684fdce611e1acf135","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.bc087f5d9fbd715608217546","order":2,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The assessment concerns one identified office and one identified set of services; all three facts refer to that same assessment.","Applicable regulated-activity carve-outs have been resolved before supplying regulated_services.","The requested result is satisfaction of Q3's stated three-factor trigger. It does not establish a complete statutory licensing determination.","Business and territorial classifications incorporate professional assessment; unknown inputs remain unknown.","The required TRUE_IS_PROHIBITED label is used as a trigger flag only and does not imply that a licensed office's conduct is prohibited."],"citations":[{"quote":"all of which must be present in order to give rise to a licensing obligation","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u38.27681"},{"quote":"firstly, the services provided by the family office constitute one or more regulated activity as defined under the Ordinance; secondly, the family office is carrying on a business in the provision of such services; and thirdly, the business is carried on in Hong Kong.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u38.27681"},{"quote":"the licensing regime does not hinge on whether an entity is called a family office or whether its clients are families.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u18.26414"},{"quote":"the definition of Type 9 regulated activity contains an intra-group carve-out","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u39.28171"},{"quote":"will need to be determined by reference to the facts of each case","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u40.28601"},{"quote":"which is not being run as a business (i.e. not receiving any income, other than reimbursement of operating expenses from the family) or have the pursuit of profit as its business objective, should not in the ordinary course be considered as carrying on a business from a licensing perspective.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u40.28601"}],"distinction":"The express conjunction supports one formal reading of the selected trigger. The strongest uncertainty lies upstream in business classification: the ordinary-course sentence can be understood as coordinating absence of business operation and absence of a profit objective, or as making non-business operation an independent alternative because of 'or'. A genuine office receiving only expense reimbursements but pursuing profit exposes that difference: the first understanding withholds the ordinary-course expectation, while the second may support it. Neither wording establishes an automatic exemption or a definitive trigger outcome, so a rival Boolean formula would overstate the source.","family":"definitions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The identified office's assessed services constitute at least one regulated activity under the referenced Ordinance after applicable carve-outs have been resolved.","name":"regulated_services","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u39.28171"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification"},{"meaning":"The identified office carries on a business providing those same assessed services, determined from the case-specific facts with the qualified ordinary-course guidance and unresolved wording expressly considered.","name":"business_in_services","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification"},{"meaning":"The business providing those same assessed services is carried on in Hong Kong; this is a territorial finding about that business, not merely the office's name or incorporation.","name":"business_in_hong_kong","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean territorial classification"}],"result":"(and regulated_services business_in_services business_in_hong_kong)","result_type":"bool","scope":"true"},"local_id":"q3_three_factor_trigger","questions":["Can the intended attachment of the negation and 'or' in the ordinary-course sentence be confirmed from the retained source?","For a concrete assessment, have the business judgment and territorial finding been established independently of the office's label and family relationships?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_PROHIBITED] Selected control: Q3's three-factor licensing-trigger flag, after regulated-activity carve-outs are resolved. True means that regulated services, carrying on a business providing those services, and carrying on that business in Hong Kong are all established. False means this conjunction is not satisfied; it does not approve the office's conduct. The label does not assert an actual prohibition, absence of a licence, or whole-entity compliance.","subject":"Q3 licensing trigger for the assessed family office and its services"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.bc087f5d9fbd715608217546","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0}],"pending":null,"provider_id":"codex.fresh.v1.compact.v1","retrievals":[{"missing_dependencies":["missing.b8f9c69dd226e4db3f4557d7"],"node_id":"node.9964243043a58f0e1c38f972","retained_uncited_units":[{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 25812:25826","normative":true,"span":{"end":25826,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u0.25812","page":1,"quote_sha256":"325ab4191f180a1589bbbacc98c1b5436b6fc02996bf558e9a9048f1a5a67e81","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":25812,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"Family Offices","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u0.25812"},{"locator":"https://www.sf