,{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 26871:26944","normative":true,"span":{"end":26944,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u24.26871","page":1,"quote_sha256":"3607fd06b65e2bc981d70533b926a6579cfda339f4861ff4caf9e60e315725b2","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":26871,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"What constitutes a single family office for the purposes of the Circular?","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u24.26871"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 26979:26981","normative":true,"span":{"end":26981,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u27.26979","page":1,"quote_sha256":"6a699d31f54deb4cb7de7c507420ce32f6c71298d58a1178bdb7ad3051910497","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":26979,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"A:","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u27.26979"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 26995:27459","normative":true,"span":{"end":27459,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u28.26995","page":1,"quote_sha256":"5792abe814e7ec4a0b6b68c989292f78099bc9f9fb111cad8e363192eb5fe195","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":26995,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"It typically refers to an arrangement (often structured through a corporate vehicle owned or controlled by the family) under which the assets, investments and long-term interests of members of a single family are managed.  The SFC has not sought to define what relationships of blood or of law would constitute family membership because the licensing obligations under the Ordinance do not hinge on whether the clients of a family office are family members or not.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u28.26995"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 27512:27532","normative":true,"span":{"end":27532,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u32.27512","page":1,"quote_sha256":"9c1375f0ed0955380b8f1dba9efefcc9ae7efc2e133e033ba421682c3535fe29","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":27512,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"Q3                 :","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u32.27512"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 27560:27630","normative":true,"span":{"end":27630,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u34.27560","page":1,"quote_sha256":"d4667c195d4b641726d4e7ec18a11da501b2aab5850d5dd9eaaaef450f3df997","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":27560,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"Is a single family office required to be licensed under the Ordinance?","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u34.27560"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 27665:27667","normative":true,"span":{"end":27667,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u37.27665","page":1,"quote_sha256":"6a699d31f54deb4cb7de7c507420ce32f6c71298d58a1178bdb7ad3051910497","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":27665,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"A:","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u37.27665"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 29570:29590","normative":true,"span":{"end":29590,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u45.29570","page":1,"quote_sha256":"d1ac2a403d31ba8eb78ca37de072d886c43c8c02a4afb86c77e41fbd4b8a4b33","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":29570,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"Q4                 :","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u45.29570"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 29618:29837","normative":true,"span":{"end":29837,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u47.29618","page":1,"quote_sha256":"133a990658446953e6b93442b8c68de2d409d9bf9b07d4d588e6c6ec03f03364","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":29618,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"If two or more single family offices co-operate together for the purposes of sharing a common administrative infrastructure in order to reduce operating overheads, would such arrangements trigger a licensing obligation?","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u47.29618"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 29872:29874","normative":true,"span":{"end":29874,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u50.29872","page":1,"quote_sha256":"6a699d31f54deb4cb7de7c507420ce32f6c71298d58a1178bdb7ad3051910497","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":29872,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"A:","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u50.29872"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 30093:30681","normative":true,"span":{"end":30681,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u53.30093","page":1,"quote_sha256":"d96ad00ff6b18026510f5e675114a587b5afce9bc425cbc216d4352d778bd299","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":30093,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"The sharing of office premises and administrative infrastructure by two or more family offices would not of itself automatically trigger a licensing obligation for such single family offices.  However, where two or more single family offices make arrangements for the sharing of human resources involved in investment related matters, research or the investment process, this may be regarded as a multi-family office structure (see also the response to Q5 below) and, where the provision of services is carried on as a business, increases the likelihood of a licensing obligation arising.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u53.30093"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 30734:30754","normative":true,"span":{"end":30754,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u58.30734","page":1,"quote_sha256":"c30b82180252d9265e3963598254d81d82cb3474fc30990c1c9758c4e1a9ce54","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":30734,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"Q5                 :","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u58.30734"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 30782:30907","normative":true,"span":{"end":30907,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u60.30782","page":1,"quote_sha256":"530dc00b9cb3d2fa8f4b17956cf86e4ece06bb79766444ae84b19c42fcf7fba1","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":30782,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"What constitutes a multi-family office for the purposes of the Circular and is a multi-family office required to be licensed?","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u60.30782"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 30942:30944","normative":true,"span":{"end":30944,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u63.30942","page":1,"quote_sha256":"6a699d31f54deb4cb7de7c507420ce32f6c71298d58a1178bdb7ad3051910497","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":30942,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"A:","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u63.30942"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 30958:31116","normative":true,"span":{"end":31116,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u64.30958","page":1,"quote_sha256":"1b273dfbde651a6b89dbda5bc34b3b1bb5e4d3615b1854b5e4a91cccce55db4d","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":30958,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"As mentioned in the Circular, “a multi-family office by definition serves more than one high net worth family” and such arrangements are likely to be evident.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u64.30958"},{"locator":"https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/intermediaries/licensing/Family-Offices chars 31413:31436","normative":true,"span":{"end":31436,"id":"s.daa1876316641.u80.31413","page":1,"quote_sha256":"eabe8295716515dcb60ac34237be10834d3f7130c679f507a374b044132e1b6c","raw_sha256":"f6ed2d535a509cd4ef7629fd1c53159dccd9e18282aa03cd862ed070b8440f2c","source_id":"daa1876316641","start":31413,"text_sha256":"cd746cf848f7036b6b21615b7bae5300d8e7046da5ea21d359007560450128f7"},"text":"Last update: 8 Sep 2020","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u80.31413"}]}],"rounds":1,"roundtrips":[],"run_id":"run.98deff83a1104c269f71172a12f08a93","stop":null}